OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust selected for specialist
OL,4,Asupport scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Surrey and Sussex has been selected
OL,7,Fas one of 12 pilot areas for a national
OL,8,Fprogramme which aims to improve support
OL,9,Ffor people affected by domestic abuse
OL,10,Fand sexual violence.
OL,12,FThe nationally-funded Steps to Safety
OL,13,Fprogramme will coordinate support by
OL,14,Fbringing together organisations from
OL,15,Facross both counties, including GPs,
OL,16,Flocal authorities, safeguarding
OL,17,Fpartners and specialist voluntary
OL,18,Fsector services.
OL,20,FWork on the initial phase will now
OL,21,Fbegin, with delivery expected to begin
OL,22,Ffrom early 2027.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
