OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust selected for specialist
OL,4,Asupport scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison Cannon, chief nursing officer
OL,7,Fat NHS Surrey and Sussex says this
OL,8,Fprogramme "gives us an opportunity to
OL,9,Fconnect primary care more consistently"
OL,10,Fwith specialist services already in
OL,11,Fplace.
